ent-WLCharcoalFuel10 = dry charcoal
    .desc = Dry charcoal from an old fire pit. It lights easier than coal and burns longer than firewood.
ent-WLCharcoalFuel1 = dry charcoal
    .desc = Dry charcoal from an old fire pit. It lights easier than coal and burns longer than firewood.
